  "bio": "At King Crow Tattoo Social Club, located in the heart of North Olmsted, you'll discover a vibrant sanctuary for ink enthusiasts. Specializing in bold newschool designs and the timeless elegance of black & gray tattoos, our talented artists are dedicated to bringing your unique visions to life. Follow our journey and stay updated on the latest creations at @heartbreakohio, 28923 Lorain Rd. - where artistry and community meet.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: North Olmsted, Ohio, United States\n\nFollow our new shop page for all things current. @heartbreakohio \n28923 Lorain Rd.\nNorth Olmsted, OH 44070\n440-617-6533",
